Planet{name='Saturn', distance=1427.0}
Planet{name='Uranus', distance=2871.0}
Planet{name='Neptune', distance=4497.0}
```

Please note that this code snippet assumes the provided CSV data is stored as a String. If your data is saved in a file, you can modify the `parseCSVData` method to read the CSV file using a suitable library like Apache Commons CSV or OpenCSV.

